  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the ruins of Moshy's Pitt, Wrench spent his early days scavenging for scraps and dodging rogue bots. He witnessed firsthand the slow death of DRIP liquidity and vowed to do something about it, even if it meant getting his feathers ruffled.",
